{"id": "unknown-2026-08-10-003", "date": "2026-08-10", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 8, "week": 33, "weekday": "Mon"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["grid_parity", "industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Zinc oxide UV shield cuts heterojunction solar cell degradation and boosts lifetime output by 4.8%", "content": "<p>Researchers in China have demonstrated that zinc oxide (ZnO) thin films can act as a 'sunscreen' for heterojunction solar cells, reducing UV-induced degradation while maintaining high visible-light transmission. ZnO-coated modules achieved lower projected LCOE and 4.8% higher cumulative power generation over 25 years.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/08/10/zinc-oxide-uv-shield-cuts-heterojunction-solar-cell-degradation-and-boosts-lifetime-output-by-4-8/\">Zinc oxide UV", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/08/10/zinc-oxide-uv-shield-cuts-heterojunction-solar-cell-degradation-and-boosts-lifetime-output-by-4-8/", "type": "rss"}]}
